diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 4469b86..ec0ae6a 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -60,3 +60,24 @@ Marks all unread notifications as read.
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `PATCH /:account_slug/notifications/settings`
+
+Updates the current user's notification settings.
+
+Notifications are emailed in bundles: the first notification of a bundle opens a time window, and every
+notification that lands while that window is open is emailed together when it closes.
+`bundle_email_frequency` sets how long that window is, and can be one of `never`, `every_few_hours`,
+`daily`, or `weekly`.
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "bundle_email_frequency": "daily"
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success, or `422 Unprocessable Entity` for an unknown frequency.
